<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Aerobic Base</name>
  <description>FUEL:
Target 60g carbs/hr. Practice this prescription.

WARM-UP:
-10min easing from Z1 to low Z2.

MAIN SET:
-2h30 total. Hold steady aerobic Z2 (65-75% FTP), alternating gently every 20min so it doesn't go dead.
-Cadence 85-95rpm, seated, relaxed.

EXECUTION:
-Conversational the whole way. If you can't talk, you're too high. This ride builds the aerobic base everything else sits on — the win is time-in-zone, not watts.

NUTRITION:
-60 g/hr. Start fueling in the first 30min.

HYDRATION:
-500-750ml/hr with electrolytes; more in heat.

RPE guide: 71% FTP -> RPE 3; 68% FTP -> RPE 3</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <Warmup Duration="600" PowerLow="0.50" PowerHigh="0.65"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="1200" Power="0.68"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="1200" Power="0.71"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="1200" Power="0.68"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="1200" Power="0.71"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="1200" Power="0.68"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="1200" Power="0.71"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="900" Power="0.68"/>
    <Cooldown Duration="300" PowerLow="0.60" PowerHigh="0.45"/>
  </workout>
</workout_file>